{
  "episodeId": "01-sanjia-fenjin",
  "title": "三家分晋",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "s01-title",
      "type": "title",
      "narration": "公元前 403 年，周威烈王封晋国大夫魏斯、赵籍、韩虔为诸侯。司马光把这件事放在《资治通鉴》第一行。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 248,
      "title": "三家分晋",
      "subtitle": "资治通鉴 · 第一集",
      "yearLabel": "公元前 403 年",
      "transition": {
        "type": "none",
        "durationInFrames": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-hook",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "一纸册封，为什么被看作天下大乱的开始？",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 111,
      "heading": "一纸册封",
      "keywords": [
        "公元前 403 年",
        "三家分晋"
      ],
      "background": "ink",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-li",
      "type": "quote",
      "narration": "司马光在开篇的“臣光曰”里给出答案：“天子之职莫大于礼，礼莫大于分，分莫大于名。”天子最要紧的是守住礼制，礼的核心是君臣名分。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 346,
      "text": "天子之职莫大于礼，礼莫大于分，分莫大于名。",
      "source": "《资治通鉴》卷第一·周纪一",
      "attribution": "司马光",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "transition": {
        "type": "scroll",
        "durationInFrames": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-mingfen",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "韩、赵、魏本是晋国的臣子，瓜分了君主的土地，周天子不但不讨伐，反而封他们做诸侯，等于亲手毁掉名分。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 274,
      "title": "三家分晋",
      "focus": [
        "han",
        "zhao",
        "wei"
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-transition",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "名分一坏，天下只认拳头，战国开场。那么，这三家是怎么做大的？故事得从晋国的智伯说起。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 235,
      "heading": "故事从智伯说起",
      "keywords": [
        "战国",
        "智伯"
      ],
      "background": "ink",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-zhi",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "晋国末年，智氏最强。智宣子要立儿子智瑶，也就是后来的智伯。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 163,
      "heading": "智氏最强",
      "keywords": [
        "智宣子",
        "智瑶"
      ],
      "background": "paper",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-zhi-guo",
      "type": "quote",
      "narration": "族人智果急了：“瑶之贤于人者五，其不逮者一也。”",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 124,
      "text": "瑶之贤于人者五，其不逮者一也。",
      "source": "《资治通鉴》卷第一·周纪一",
      "attribution": "智果",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "transition": {
        "type": "scroll",
        "durationInFrames": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08-wuxian",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "智瑶相貌堂堂、武艺高强、多才多艺、能言善辩、刚毅果敢，样样过人，却有一个短处：不仁。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 222,
      "heading": "五贤一不仁",
      "keywords": [
        "才",
        "不仁"
      ],
      "background": "ink",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09-zhi-guo-warn",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "智果说，用长处压人、以不仁行事，智氏必灭。智宣子不听；智果另立辅氏，和家族划清界限。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 228,
      "speakers": [
        "zhi-guo",
        "zhi-xuanzi"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhi-guo",
          "text": "智宗必灭。",
          "gesture": "raise"
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10-zhao",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "另一边，赵简子也在选继承人。他把训诫写在两片竹简上，交给伯鲁和无恤。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 196,
      "heading": "赵简子试子",
      "keywords": [
        "竹简",
        "无恤"
      ],
      "background": "paper",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11-bamboo",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "三年后考试：伯鲁背不出，竹简也丢了；无恤背得滚瓜烂熟，竹简从袖子里掏出来，还带着。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 228,
      "speakers": [
        "zhao-jianzi",
        "zhao-xiangzi"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhao-jianzi",
          "text": "谨识之。",
          "gesture": "raise"
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-zhao-xiangzi",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "于是立无恤，就是赵襄子。一个把教诲带在身上，一个丢在脑后，赵家的命运已见高下。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 222,
      "heading": "赵襄子",
      "keywords": [
        "无恤",
        "赵襄子"
      ],
      "background": "ink",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-ask-han",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "智宣子死后，智伯执政。他仗着势大，向韩康子要地。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 130,
      "title": "智伯索地",
      "focus": [
        "zhi",
        "han"
      ],
      "arrows": [
        {
          "from": "zhi",
          "to": "han",
          "label": "索地",
          "kind": "march",
          "progress": 1
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-han-gives",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "韩康子不想给，谋士段规劝他：给。智伯尝到甜头，还会向别人要；别人不给，他就动兵，我们正好等变化。韩康子给了一座万户之邑。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 333,
      "title": "韩氏献地",
      "focus": [
        "han"
      ],
      "arrows": [
        {
          "from": "zhi",
          "to": "han",
          "label": "万家之邑",
          "kind": "march",
          "progress": 1
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-refuse",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "智伯又向魏桓子要地，魏桓子也给了。轮到赵襄子，他说：不给。智伯大怒，带着韩、魏的军队来打赵氏。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 254,
      "title": "赵氏拒绝",
      "focus": [
        "zhao"
      ],
      "arrows": [
        {
          "from": "zhi",
          "to": "zhao",
          "label": "攻赵",
          "kind": "attack",
          "progress": 1
        },
        {
          "from": "han",
          "to": "zhao",
          "label": "",
          "kind": "march",
          "progress": 1
        },
        {
          "from": "wei",
          "to": "zhao",
          "label": "",
          "kind": "march",
          "progress": 1
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-jinyang",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "赵襄子往哪儿跑？长子城近，城墙厚，可百姓被榨干力气，不会跟他死守；邯郸仓库满，却是搜刮来的，也不行。他选了晋阳，父亲嘱咐过、尹铎宽厚治理过的地方。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 404,
      "title": "退守晋阳",
      "focus": [
        "zhao"
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17-flood",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "智伯围住晋阳，引水灌城。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 65,
      "title": "水灌晋阳",
      "focus": [
        "zhao"
      ],
      "flood": {
        "active": true,
        "level": 0.7
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18-three-ban",
      "type": "quote",
      "narration": "“城不浸者三版”，城墙只剩三版没被淹；“沉灶产蛙，民无叛意”，灶台泡在水里都能养青蛙，城里却没人想投降。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 274,
      "text": "城不浸者三版；沉灶产蛙，民无叛意。",
      "source": "《资治通鉴》卷第一·周纪一",
      "attribution": "司马光",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "transition": {
        "type": "scroll",
        "durationInFrames": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-chici",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "眼看要破城，谋士絺疵提醒智伯：韩、魏必反。说好灭赵后三分赵地，城快降了，韩康子和魏桓子却满脸忧色。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 274,
      "speakers": [
        "chi-ci",
        "zhi-yao"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "chi-ci",
          "text": "韩、魏必反矣。",
          "gesture": "raise"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "zhi-yao",
          "text": "子何以知之？",
          "gesture": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20-denial",
      "type": "narration",
      "narration": "智伯不信，还把这话告诉二人。二人矢口否认。絺疵知道劝不动，请求出使齐国，走了。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 215,
      "heading": "智伯不信",
      "keywords": [
        "絺疵",
        "出使齐国"
      ],
      "background": "ink",
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-zhang",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "赵襄子派张孟谈悄悄出城，去见韩、魏。张孟谈只说中要害：“唇亡则齿寒。”赵亡，下一个就是韩、魏。双方约定日期。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 280,
      "speakers": [
        "zhang-mengtan",
        "han-kangzi",
        "wei-huanzi"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhang-mengtan",
          "text": "唇亡则齿寒。",
          "gesture": "raise"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "han-kangzi",
          "text": "我心知其然也。",
          "gesture": "nod"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "wei-huanzi",
          "text": "恐事未遂而谋泄。",
          "gesture": "nod"
        }
      ],
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "durationInFrames": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22-counter",
      "type": "map",
      "narration": "当夜，赵襄子派人杀掉守堤官吏，决开堤坝，大水反灌智伯军营。",
      "estimatedDurationInFrames": 163,
      "title": "决水反灌",
      "focus": [
        "zhi"
      ],
      "flood": {
        "active": true,
        "level": 0.9
      },
      "arrows": [
